{
  "$comment": "UML 2 sequence diagrams for the README and /architecture. Participants reference topology nodes (`node`), resources owned by a node (`resource`), Kafka topics (`covers`) or declared externals. Steps support messages (sync / async / reply), self-calls, notes and the combined fragments alt, opt, par, loop, break and critical. Behaviour is taken from the service code (agent, knowledge, analytics-aggregator, notification, MCP gateway). Run `npm run docs:architecture` after editing.",
  "sequences": [
    {
      "key": "ask-agent",
      "title": "Ask AI Agent",
      "summary": "A grounded answer streamed over SSE: the gateway authenticates and proxies, the agent reserves a daily budget and runs guardrails, retrieval searches the RAG chunks that publishing writes and degrades instead of failing, and run telemetry goes through an outbox so it never blocks the answer.",
      "result": "Grounded answer with canonical sources, inside a daily cost budget",
